This directory tree contains the MCC Interim distribution of Linux,
release 1.0+.  The following is a summary of the contents of this
directory:

     README          This file.
     Bugs+Warnings   Warnings, bug reports, and log of changes.
     images          Gzipped boot and root disks.
     packages        Recommended packages to be installed as
                     part of this distribution.
     extra_packages  Optional packages for this distribution.
     extra_kernels   Compiled kernels with more limited configurations.
     sources         Source files for all binaries in all packages.
     documentation   Complete documentation in tex, dvi, ps, and ASCII.
     contributions   Sources and packages accompanying this distribution
                     but not part of it.
